<slide xmlns="https://www.larkoffice.com/sml/2.0"><style><fill><fillColor color="rgb(250,245,240)"/></fill></style><data><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="34" width="864" height="52"><content textType="body" fontSize="30" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" wrap="false"><p>课堂任务：轮到你做一次知识创造</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="96" width="864" height="70"><content textType="body" fontSize="22" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3"><p>两人一组，从下面三条中选一条，改掉古诺的一条假设，推出新的均衡，再与古诺结果对照。时间 25 分钟。</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="184" width="48" height="44"><content textType="body" fontSize="28" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(210,90,86)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" wrap="false"><p>A</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="100" topLeftY="184" width="812" height="60"><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.25"><p>两家成本不同：<formula><latex><![CDATA[c_1\neq c_2]]></latex></formula>。各自的均衡产量是多少？成本更低的一家多生产多少？</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="258" width="48" height="44"><content textType="body" fontSize="28" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(210,90,86)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" wrap="false"><p>B</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="100" topLeftY="258" width="812" height="60"><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.25"><p>政府按每单位征税 <formula><latex><![CDATA[t]]></latex></formula>：新的价格是多少？税由谁负担，消费者承担几分之几？</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="332" width="48" height="44"><content textType="body" fontSize="28" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(210,90,86)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" wrap="false"><p>C</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="100" topLeftY="332" width="812" height="60"><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.25"><p>三家厂商、成本相同：求出均衡产量，并试着归纳 <formula><latex><![CDATA[n]]></latex></formula> 家时的一般公式。</p></content></shape><line startX="48" startY="414" endX="912" endY="414"><border color="rgb(214,200,194)" width="2"/></line><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="426" width="864" height="60"><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3"><p>提交一张纸，写清四项：新假设、推导过程、与古诺结果的对照、你认为的模型局限。</p></content></shape></data><note><content textType="body" fontSize="14"><p>任务的目的不是得到标准答案，而是完整走一遍六个动作。</p><p>巡视时可以只问两个问题：你改掉的是哪一条假设？你的结果和古诺差在哪里？</p><p>参考答案供教师使用：A 题两家产量分别为 (a − 2c₁ + c₂)/3b 和 (a − 2c₂ + c₁)/3b；B 题价格上升 t/3，消费者承担三分之一；C 题每家产量为 (a − c)/4b。</p></content></note></slide>